    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1407">

                <pb facs="1245" n="987" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg987"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 867.4016/91</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">to the Ambassador in Turkey</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Morgenthau</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-08-18T17:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 18, 1915, 5 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>955. Your 924, August 11, and 929, 12th. Has protest by German Ambassador
                    improved conditions?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
